1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,999
[Music] My name is Prathibha Shivakumar. I am working as a staff nurse in Saudi Arabia.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,999
My native place is Palayamkunnu, Varkala. This is my husband Shivakumar. After our marriage, for nine years we did not have children.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,999
We tried various treatments, but nothing worked. I came to know about the Mother through the Kreupasanam newsletter.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:45,999
In November 2023, we came here and made a covenant under the intercession of the Mother of Kreupasanam. After one year of fulfilling the covenant, my pregnancy tested positive. On June 8, by God’s grace, the Mother blessed us with a baby girl.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,999
Many thanks to the Mother and Jesus. We daily used the covenant articles including holy oil and blessed salt.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:09,999
After taking the covenant, I listened to testimonies every day. I listened to Father Joseph’s meditation every Tuesday, and his word talks gave me a lot of positive energy.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:21,999
I myself started a group called Kreupasanam, where I share Jesus’ words, testimonies, and Father’s meditations.

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:28,999
Whatever troubles people share with me, I tell them about the grace of the Mother of Kreupasanam through Kreupasanam.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,999
More than 10 people have come here and made the covenant after I shared my experience.

10
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,999
Some of them have already given their testimonies. I have also visited orphanages as a work of mercy, providing food and financial support.

11
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:51,999
Being a nurse, I treat the patients who come to me with care and provide them with the help they need.

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:04,999
Both small and large, the Mother has showered many blessings in my life. I pray that the blessings of Jesus and the Mother, and the presence of the Mother, continue to remain in my life.

13
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,999
I also pray that for everyone present here, the Mother fulfills their covenant requests as soon as possible.

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:25,999
As it is written in the Gospel of Luke, Chapter 11, Verse 13: “If you then, though you are evil, know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more will the heavenly Father give the Holy Spirit to those who ask him?”

15
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:33,999
This is Jesus’ promise. No matter how far we may drift from Him, the heavenly Father will give us everything.

16
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:50,999
The heavenly Father protects us. This great covenant is written by Jesus for us in our new law—the Bible. Each promise is a covenant, and we know it as a sacred vow.

17
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:57,999
The Bible was once called the “Book of Covenant.” Our covenant is our life. To live according to the Word is the essence of the covenant life.

18
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:12,999
Here, Prathibha and Shivakumar, who had been without children for nine years during a very sorrowful period, came here and sincerely prayed when they made their covenant.

19
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:22,999
The Holy Mother granted them a great gift—a child—of 47 days old. They prepared and prayed with great longing to bring the child to the altar for the first time.

20
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:45,999
They came here with much devotion. Let us thank Jesus and the Holy Mother. Even during this significant time, they always loved others and sincerely loved Jesus with great care and commitment.

21
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:51,999
Every step and every day, they lived faithfully in the covenant. This is the special aspect of their testimony of apparition.

22
00:03:52,000 --> 00:04:08,999
Likewise, Prathibha and Shivakumar created a WhatsApp group called Kreupasanam, where they invite anyone and everyone to love and receive Jesus.

23
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:22,999
Many people, after hearing their words and testimonies, have come to make the covenant at Kreupasanam and give their own testimonies. Jesus has allowed this.

24
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:40,999
May all our covenant intentions be united, and may we glorify Jesus repeatedly through these testimonies. Let us present this great testimony of Prathibha Shivakumar with gratitude to Jesus and the Holy Mother.

25
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:48,999
These extraordinary divine experiences are now available to you as well. If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe now.

26
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Share this video with your friends and become a messenger of the Lord.
